#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:3
msgid "Set up the receipt printer and cash drawer (about 10 minutes)"
msgstr "Siapkan printer struk dan laci kas (sekitar 10 menit)"

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:6
msgid "Install the printer on the cashier computer."
msgstr "Pasang printer di komputer kasir."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:7
msgid ""
"Connect it by USB (or Wi-Fi/Bluetooth), install the driver from the "
"printer's CD or the maker's website, and set it as the default printer. "
"Choose 80 mm paper (or 58 mm for small printers)."
msgstr ""
"Sambungkan lewat USB (atau Wi-Fi/Bluetooth), pasang driver dari CD printer "
"atau situs produsen, lalu jadikan printer bawaan. Pilih kertas 80 mm (atau "
"58 mm untuk printer kecil)."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:10
msgid "Plug in the cash drawer."
msgstr "Sambungkan laci kas."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:11
msgid ""
"The drawer cable (a phone-style plug) goes into the printer's port marked "
"“DK” or “Drawer”."
msgstr ""
"Kabel laci (colokan seperti telepon) masuk ke port printer bertanda “DK” "
"atau “Drawer”."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:14
msgid "Tell the printer driver to open the drawer."
msgstr "Atur driver printer agar membuka laci."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:15
msgid ""
"On Windows: Settings → Printers → your receipt printer → Printing "
"preferences (or Printer properties). Look for “Cash drawer” or “Peripherals” "
"and choose “Open drawer #1 before printing”. The name varies by brand:"
msgstr ""
"Di Windows: Settings → Printers → printer struk Anda → Printing preferences "
"(atau Printer properties). Cari “Cash drawer” atau “Peripherals” lalu pilih "
"“Open drawer #1 before printing”. Namanya berbeda tiap merek:"

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:17
msgid ""
"Printing preferences → Document settings / Printer settings → Cash drawer → "
"“Open drawer #1 before printing”."
msgstr ""
"Printing preferences → Document settings / Printer settings → Cash drawer → "
"“Open drawer #1 before printing”."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:18
msgid ""
"Printer properties → Device settings → “Cash drawer” → open before printing."
msgstr ""
"Printer properties → Device settings → “Cash drawer” → buka sebelum mencetak."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:19
msgid ""
"Printer properties → Device settings → Peripheral unit type “Cash drawer”, "
"open at “Document top”."
msgstr ""
"Printer properties → Device settings → Peripheral unit type “Cash drawer”, "
"buka di “Document top”."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:23
msgid "Turn on the switch above and save."
msgstr "Aktifkan sakelar di atas lalu simpan."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:24
msgid ""
"From now on, every cash payment and every “Open drawer (no sale)” prints a "
"small slip, and the driver opens the drawer."
msgstr ""
"Mulai sekarang, setiap pembayaran tunai dan setiap “Buka laci kas (tanpa "
"penjualan)” mencetak slip kecil, dan driver membuka laci."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:27
msgid "Optional: print without the print window."
msgstr "Opsional: cetak tanpa jendela cetak."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:28
msgid ""
"Make a Chrome shortcut for the dashboard: right-click the Chrome icon → "
"Properties, and add --kiosk-printing at the end of “Target” (after the "
"quotes). Open the dashboard with that shortcut, and receipts and slips print "
"immediately on the default printer."
msgstr ""
"Buat pintasan Chrome untuk dasbor: klik kanan ikon Chrome → Properties, lalu "
"tambahkan --kiosk-printing di akhir “Target” (setelah tanda kutip). Buka "
"dasbor dengan pintasan itu, maka struk dan slip langsung tercetak di printer "
"bawaan."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:31
msgid "Test it"
msgstr "Uji"

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:31
msgid ""
"use “Print test slip” below. The slip should print and the drawer should "
"open. If the drawer stays closed, check step 3 (some drawers need “drawer "
"#2”)."
msgstr ""
"gunakan “Cetak slip uji” di bawah. Slip harus tercetak dan laci harus "
"terbuka. Jika laci tetap tertutup, periksa langkah 3 (beberapa laci perlu "
"“drawer #2”)."

#: templates/dashboard/_printer_guide.html:34
msgid ""
"Phones and tablets: print through the printer maker's app or print service. "
"Whether the drawer opens depends on that app."
msgstr ""
"Ponsel dan tablet: cetak melalui aplikasi atau layanan cetak produsen "
"printer. Apakah laci terbuka tergantung aplikasi tersebut."

