#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:16
msgid ""
"Send your API key in the Authorization header of every request. Requests "
"must use HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"Kirim kunci API di header Authorization pada setiap permintaan. Permintaan "
"wajib memakai HTTPS."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:18
msgid ""
"Keys starting with <code>qrm_test_</code> are test (sandbox) keys: every "
"endpoint works the same, but orders are simulated. They are not sent to the "
"kitchen and never count as revenue."
msgstr ""
"Kunci berawalan <code>qrm_test_</code> adalah kunci uji (sandbox): semua "
"endpoint bekerja sama, tetapi pesanan disimulasikan. Tidak dikirim ke dapur "
"dan tidak pernah dihitung sebagai pendapatan."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Each key may make %(rate)s requests per minute. Above that you get HTTP 429 "
"with a Retry-After header. Every request is logged on the Ordering API page."
msgstr ""
"Setiap kunci boleh membuat %(rate)s permintaan per menit. Di atas itu Anda "
"mendapat HTTP 429 dengan header Retry-After. Setiap permintaan dicatat di "
"halaman API pemesanan."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:22
msgid ""
"Errors use the HTTP status code and a JSON body with a code and a message:"
