"Akun tidak memiliki paket Pro aktif, atau profil usaha belum terverifikasi. "
"Akses API otomatis dimatikan."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:31
msgid "The branch is not one this key may use."
msgstr "Cabang ini bukan yang boleh dipakai kunci ini."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:32
msgid "Unknown order or endpoint."
msgstr "Pesanan atau endpoint tidak dikenal."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:33
msgid ""
"The order can't be placed or changed: sold-out items, a total that doesn't "
"match the menu prices, a branch that is closed, or a status change that "
"isn't allowed."
msgstr ""
"Pesanan tidak bisa dibuat atau diubah: item habis, total tidak sesuai harga "
"menu, cabang tutup, atau perubahan status yang tidak diizinkan."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:34
msgid "Too many requests; wait a minute."
msgstr "Terlalu banyak permintaan; tunggu satu menit."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:39
msgid "The branches this key can use (only live branches)."
msgstr "Cabang yang bisa dipakai kunci ini (hanya cabang aktif)."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:46
msgid ""
"Menu categories, items, add-ons and prices of one branch. Use the item and "
"add-on ids in orders."
msgstr ""
"Kategori menu, item, tambahan, dan harga satu cabang. Pakai id item dan "
"tambahan dalam pesanan."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:55
msgid ""
"Create an order. Prices always come from the menu; if you send a total and "
"it doesn't match, the order is refused with the correct total. The order "
"appears immediately on the branch's dashboard with a notification."
msgstr ""
"Membuat pesanan. Harga selalu dari menu; jika total yang dikirim tidak "
"cocok, pesanan ditolak beserta total yang benar. Pesanan langsung muncul di "
"dasbor cabang dengan notifikasi."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:77
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Kolom"

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:79
msgid "Branch id (optional when the key can use only one branch)."
msgstr "Id cabang (opsional jika kunci hanya bisa memakai satu cabang)."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:80
msgid ""
"1–50 lines: menu_item (id), quantity (1–50), options (add-on ids, optional), "
"note (optional)."
msgstr ""
"1–50 baris: menu_item (id), quantity (1–50), options (id tambahan, "
"opsional), note (opsional)."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:81
msgid "Optional. The total you expect; checked against the menu prices."
msgstr "Opsional. Total yang Anda harapkan; dicek terhadap harga menu."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:83
msgid ""
"true when the customer already paid in your app (the order is recorded as "
"paid)."
msgstr ""
"true jika pelanggan sudah membayar di aplikasi Anda (pesanan dicatat lunas)."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:84
msgid "Optional."
msgstr "Opsional."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:85
msgid ""
"Optional: your own order number. Sending the same reference again returns "
"the existing order instead of creating a duplicate, so retries are safe."
msgstr ""
"Opsional: nomor pesanan Anda sendiri. Mengirim referensi yang sama lagi "
"mengembalikan pesanan yang ada alih-alih membuat duplikat, jadi pengulangan "
"aman."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:90
msgid "Order details and current status."
msgstr "Detail pesanan dan status saat ini."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:94
msgid ""
"Change the status. Statuses: received → preparing → ready → completed; an "
"order can be cancelled until it is ready. Only completed orders count as "
"revenue; cancelled orders never do."
msgstr ""
"Ubah status. Status: received → preparing → ready → completed; pesanan bisa "
"dibatalkan sampai siap. Hanya pesanan selesai yang dihitung pendapatan; yang "
"dibatalkan tidak pernah."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:99
msgid ""
"Add a webhook URL on the Ordering API page. When an order is created or its "
"status changes, we POST this JSON to your URL (timeout 5 seconds, no "
"redirects):"
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan URL webhook di halaman API pemesanan. Saat pesanan dibuat atau "
"berubah status, kami POST JSON ini ke URL Anda (batas 5 detik, tanpa "
"pengalihan):"

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:108
msgid ""
"Events: order.created, order.status_changed, and ping (the Send test "
"button). To check that a request really comes from us, compute HMAC-SHA256 "
"of the timestamp, a dot and the raw body with your signing secret, and "
"compare it with the signature:"
msgstr ""
"Event: order.created, order.status_changed, dan ping (tombol Kirim uji). "
"Untuk memastikan permintaan benar dari kami, hitung HMAC-SHA256 dari "
"timestamp, titik, dan isi mentah dengan rahasia penandatanganan, lalu "
"bandingkan dengan tanda tangannya:"

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:115
msgid ""
"When an API order is completed, it is added to the branch's revenue as an "
"entry with the source “API – key name”. On the Branches page you can filter "
"revenue by source."
