#: templates/storefront/home.html:30
msgid ""
"A QR code menu and table ordering for your restaurant. Customers scan the "
"code on the table, order from their phone, and the order goes straight to "
"your kitchen. They don't need an app or an account."
msgstr ""
"Menu kode QR dan pemesanan di meja untuk restoran Anda. Pelanggan memindai "
"kode di meja, memesan dari ponsel, dan pesanan langsung masuk ke dapur. "
"Mereka tidak perlu aplikasi atau akun."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:33 templates/storefront/home.html:129
msgid "Open dashboard"
msgstr "Buka dasbor"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:40
msgid "Rather talk to us? We call you back and set up your menu for you →"
msgstr "Lebih suka bicara langsung? Kami telepon balik dan siapkan menu Anda →"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:47
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Cara kerjanya"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:50
msgid "Create your menu"
msgstr "Buat menu Anda"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:50
msgid ""
"Add dishes, photos, prices and add-ons in English, Tetum and Bahasa "
"Indonesia."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan hidangan, foto, harga, dan tambahan dalam bahasa Inggris, Tetun, "
"dan Bahasa Indonesia."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:51
msgid "Print your QR codes"
msgstr "Cetak kode QR Anda"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:51
msgid "One code per table. Print them and place one on each table."
msgstr "Satu kode per meja. Cetak dan letakkan satu di setiap meja."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:52
msgid "Receive orders live"
msgstr "Terima pesanan secara langsung"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:52
msgid ""
"Orders appear instantly on the kitchen screen with a sound alert. Customers "
"can follow their order on their phone."
msgstr ""
"Pesanan langsung muncul di layar dapur dengan bunyi peringatan. Pelanggan "
"dapat memantau pesanan di ponsel."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:57
msgid "Video: how customers order with QR Menu"
msgstr "Video: cara pelanggan memesan dengan QR Menu"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:60
msgid ""
"Watch how a customer orders, from scanning the table's QR code to the "
"kitchen (50 seconds)."
msgstr ""
"Lihat cara pelanggan memesan, dari memindai kode QR di meja hingga ke dapur "
"(50 detik)."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:66
msgid "Works on any phone"
msgstr "Bisa di ponsel apa saja"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:66
msgid ""
"Customers scan with the phone camera. No app, no account, and it loads fast "
"on slow connections."
msgstr ""
"Pelanggan memindai dengan kamera ponsel. Tanpa aplikasi, tanpa akun, dan "
"cepat dimuat meski koneksi lambat."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:67
msgid "Kitchen screen"
msgstr "Layar dapur"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:67
msgid "New → Preparing → Ready → Completed, with timers and notes."
msgstr "Baru → Disiapkan → Siap → Selesai, dengan pengatur waktu dan catatan."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:68
msgid "Tables & sessions"
msgstr "Meja & sesi"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:68
msgid ""
"Several people can order from one table, and you see one bill per table."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa orang dapat memesan dari satu meja, dan Anda melihat satu tagihan "
"per meja."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:69
msgid "Cash & change"
msgstr "Tunai & kembalian"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:69
msgid "Mark orders paid in one tap, and see the change to give back."
msgstr ""
"Tandai pesanan lunas dengan sekali ketuk, dan lihat kembalian yang harus "
"diberikan."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:70
msgid "Sold out in one tap"
msgstr "Tandai habis sekali ketuk"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:70
msgid "Customers' menus update immediately."
msgstr "Menu pelanggan langsung diperbarui."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:71
msgid "Daily revenue, best sellers and CSV export."
msgstr "Pendapatan harian, menu terlaris, dan ekspor CSV."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:78
msgid "We call you back"
msgstr "Kami telepon balik"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:79
msgid ""
"No time to set it up? Leave your number. We call you, answer your questions, "
"and if you like we set up your menu for you: just send us photos of your "
"menu on WhatsApp. Free, no obligation."
msgstr ""
"Tidak sempat menyiapkan? Tinggalkan nomor Anda. Kami telepon, jawab "
"pertanyaan Anda, dan bila mau kami siapkan menu Anda: cukup kirim foto menu "
"lewat WhatsApp. Gratis, tanpa kewajiban."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:81
msgid "We enter your dishes, prices and photos"
msgstr "Kami masukkan hidangan, harga, dan foto Anda"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:82
msgid "We help you print the QR codes for your tables"
msgstr "Kami bantu cetak kode QR untuk meja Anda"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:83
msgid "In English, Tetum or Bahasa Indonesia"
msgstr "Dalam bahasa Inggris, Tetun, atau Indonesia"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:89
msgid "Thank you! We will call you soon."
msgstr "Terima kasih! Kami akan segera menelepon Anda."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:90
msgid ""
"Usually the same day. You can already send photos of your menu to our "
"WhatsApp."
msgstr ""
"Biasanya di hari yang sama. Anda sudah bisa mengirim foto menu ke WhatsApp "
"kami."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:96
msgid ""
"Too many requests from this network. Please try again later or message us on "
"WhatsApp."
msgstr ""
"Terlalu banyak permintaan dari jaringan ini. Coba lagi nanti atau kirim "
"pesan lewat WhatsApp."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:101
msgid "Call me back"
msgstr "Telepon saya"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:102
msgid "We only use your number to contact you about QR Menu."
msgstr "Kami hanya memakai nomor Anda untuk menghubungi soal QR Menu."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:109
msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "Harga"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:110
msgid "Simple monthly plans. No setup fees."
msgstr "Paket bulanan sederhana. Tanpa biaya pemasangan."

